# ::: :/.gitattributes
#
#

# Every checkout is byte-identical, on every platform. Without this, the
# Windows release runner checks LICENSE out with CRLF line endings, so the
# same licence ships with a different checksum in the Windows archives than
# in the unix ones. It would do the same to claude-status-line.sh, which is a
# rather more serious matter for anyone running it under WSL or MSYS.
* -text
